WEBVTT

00:06:59.373 --> 00:07:02.585
Now there is no easy formula here.

00:07:03.878 --> 00:07:05.546
Every dad is different.

00:07:06.172 --> 00:07:07.840
Every kid is different.

00:07:08.507 --> 00:07:10.217
Every story is different.

00:07:10.926 --> 00:07:13.637
But there are a few things
we do every time.

00:07:14.138 --> 00:07:17.850
We are loving our fathers
and the fatherless back to life.

00:07:19.059 --> 00:07:23.439
(Applause)

00:07:23.981 --> 00:07:25.608
We hug our fathers.

00:07:26.942 --> 00:07:30.362
We celebrate them on birthdays
and holidays with a call